- shelf.assign(box)
+ shelf.assign(box)

= shelf.assign(box)
- Out.println(shelf.lookup[Box].map(_()).inspect)
+ Out.println(shelf.lookup[Box].map(_()).inspect)

- shelf.unassign(box)
+ shelf.unassign(box)

= shelf.unassign(box)
- Out.println(shelf.lookup[Box].map(_()).inspect)
+ Out.println(shelf.lookup[Box].map(_()).inspect)

= Out.println(shelf.lookup[Box].map(_()).inspect)
- ```
+ ```

- There is no `Box -< Shelf` relation, so a box cannot be assigned a shelf:
+ Es gibt keine Relation `Box -< Shelf`, daher kann einer Kiste kein Regalboden zugeordnet werden:

= There is no `Box -< Shelf` relation, so a box cannot be assigned a shelf:
